  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a brand-new architectural residence of remarkable scale in one of Takapuna's most tightly held coastal locations.\r\n\r\n206 Hurstmere Road is an exclusive collection of just three residences, designed to offer the presence, privacy and proportions of a substantial home with the ease of contemporary lock-up-and-leave living.\r\n\r\nSculptural curved forms, warm timber detailing, natural stone and expansive glazing create a refined coastal aesthetic, complemented by beautifully considered interiors and generous open-plan living. Private outdoor spaces, double internal-access garaging and a private lift connecting the residential levels complete an offering seldom found in new residences of this calibre. \r\n\r\nThe featured Lot 2 spans approximately 285m², with four bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, double garaging and elevated sea and Rangitoto views.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n- Only three architecturally designed residences\r\n- Private lift to each home\r\n- Double internal-access garaging\r\n- Generous open-plan living and private outdoor spaces\r\n- Premium natural materials and finishes\r\n- Sea and Rangitoto views from all three homes\r\n- Lake Pupuke views from Lot 3 \r\n\r\nLot 1\r\n240m² · 3 bed · 2.5 bath · Double garage\r\n\r\nLot 2\r\n285m² · 4 bed · 4.5 bath · Double garage\r\n\r\nLot 3\r\n326m² · 3 bed + 2 flexi · 4.5 bath · Double garage\r\n\r\nPositioned on Hurstmere Road, Takapuna Beach is moments away, along with the area's cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping and everyday amenities. Milford Shopping Centre and key transport connections are also nearby. \r\n\r\nSought-after schooling nearby includes Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls' High and Westlake Boys' High.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking a substantial brand-new home in Takapuna, this combination of architecture, scale, views, private lift access and location is remarkably difficult to replicate.\r\n\r\nOnly three will ever be created.\r\n\r\nContact Mitchell Eades for pricing, plans and further information.",
